_______________ , you can see the Great Lakes very clearly below us.
3 A We _______________ _______________ from Chicago three hours ago.
B Yes, so we’re going to _______________ in London in another four hours.
4 A Do I just need to show my _______________ when we get there?
B No, you’ll have to give them your _______________ _______________ . They’ll need to keep that.
5 A How do I _______________ the landing card?
B You write your name and other details – like the plane’s _______________ number.
2 Listen and check. Then practise in pairs.
